Package: CNA
Type: Package
Title: Co-occurrence Network Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Author:
  -  Dylan Girault [cre]
  -  Mohammed Saqr [aut]
  -  Santtu Tikka [aut]
  -  Sonsoles López-Pernas [aut]
Maintainer: Sonsoles López-Pernas <sonsoles.lopez@uef.fi>
Description: >-
    Provides tools for performing Co-occurrence Network Analysis (CNA) supporting
    long-format (sequence) and one-hot encoded data, with optional group
    comparison and automatic clustering, plus mixed (transition + co-occurrence)
    networks for one-hot data. Networks are estimated with the Nestimate package
    and plotted with cograph. Includes centrality measures, community detection,
    bootstrap validation, permutation testing, and network comparison.
